The legacy WebApp compatibility translation was derived from behavior in
zaytcevcom/lo-miniapp-sdk version 0.18.0, source commit
15b832edfd03559b12cbb2e843141f10532f5c96, and LO app miniapp-runtime commit
64c63e9e350ba35c6b96f037b6fab0b21f9047b2.

